schema: source-system
object:
  title: IARAA — Inteligência Artificial da Reforma Agrária e Agroecologia
  type: database
  steward: IARAA — Inteligência Artificial da Reforma Agrária e Agroecologia
  return_path: unset — establish via register-source
  url: https://baobab.iapc.group/pt/iaraa/
  what_it_curates: >-
    Three user modes; curated agroecology corpus; RAGFlow and custom Meta-RAG retrieval; named language-model
    dependency; corpus contribution and oral-knowledge systematization; terms and privacy; governance;
    field testing; maintenance; correction and safety.
  why_it_matters: >-
    Live beta knowledge assistant developed through MST, the World March of Women and the International
    Association for Popular Cooperation (Baobab), intended to support agroecology, popular agrarian reform
    and technological sovereignty.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: Canonical_DB.xlsx#Source-System Cards!row46
    source_lineage: https://baobab.iapc.group/pt/iaraa/
  caution: >-
    Current public evidence confirms a live beta, broad architecture and organizer-stated principles,
    but not the full corpus inventory, permissions, decision rights, evaluation, incident handling, infrastructure
    ownership or independent outcomes.
